# Table 1 — ESCI (US) retrieval quality: lake-native vs local copy vs search engines

All 22,458 queries of the ESCI US test split; every row is averaged over exactly these queries. nDCG@10 with gains E=1, S=0.1, C=0.01, I=0; R@100 = recall of Exact products in the top 100. Every system ran alone on the laptop (see timings.md for hardware), all reading the same 1,215,854 products and bge-base-en-v1.5 vectors from the Iceberg table `esci.products_us_pi`.

